Package: mega2pedgene
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2017-08-17
Title: Run Pedgene R Package on Gene Transcripts/Ranges
Description: The suite of Mega2R R packages (mega2r, mega2vcf,
mega2genabel, mega2pedgene, and mega2rtutorial) all use as input genetic
data that have been reformatted and stored in a SQLite database; this
database is initially created by the standalone Mega2 C++ program.  This
particular package, mega2pedgene, permits the user to carry out, in an
automated manner based on gene boundaries defined by a transcript
database, gene-based association tests on family data, where the
association tests are computed by the pedgene R package.
